<script>
// Video.js 10 仅在含 ::video 的页面动态加载，不进全站包；hls.js 只在有 .m3u8 时加载
async function initVideos() {
	// 同步插入媒体元素并摘掉标记再 await，避免首屏直调与 astro:page-load 重复初始化
	const players = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("video-player[data-video-src]"));
	if (players.length === 0) return;
	let hasHls = false;
	for (const player of players) {
		const { videoSrc, videoTitle } = player.dataset;
		player.removeAttribute("data-video-src");
		const isHls = new URL(videoSrc!, location.href).pathname.endsWith(".m3u8");
		hasHls ||= isHls;
		const media = document.createElement(isHls ? "hlsjs-video" : "video");
		media.setAttribute("src", videoSrc!);
		media.setAttribute("playsinline", "");
		if (videoTitle) media.setAttribute("title", videoTitle);
		media.addEventListener("loadedmetadata", () => player.removeAttribute("data-loading"), { once: true });
		player.querySelector("video-skin")!.append(media);
	}
	// player 必须先于 skin 注册，否则 skin 拿不到 feature，控制条偶发不显示
	await import("@videojs/html/video/player");
	await Promise.all([
		import("@videojs/html/video/skin"),
		hasHls && import("@videojs/html/media/hlsjs-video"),
	]);
}

initVideos();
document.addEventListener("astro:page-load", initVideos);
</script>
